---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Donvan Grobler" description="Professional profile of Donvan Grobler: Earth observation, applied AI, product development and programme leadership.">
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Technology is valuable when it becomes usable.</h1>
      <p class="lead">I am an Earth-observation and product professional based in Innsbruck, Austria. My work combines technical delivery, programme leadership and product thinking, with a particular interest in making geospatial capabilities more accessible.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section compact">
    <div class="container grid two">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>How I work</h2>
        <p>I enjoy working across the boundaries that often separate domain experts, software engineers, data scientists, product teams and end users. Much of my work is about creating enough shared understanding to move from an interesting capability to a dependable service.</p>
        <p>My current interests include natural-language access to Earth-observation information, adaptive geospatial processing, agent-assisted development, service operationalisation and outcome-oriented product strategy.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Areas of focus</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Earth-observation products and services</li>
          <li>Applied AI and human–AI interaction</li>
          <li>Programme and technical project leadership</li>
          <li>Product discovery and service design</li>
          <li>Geospatial platforms and cloud workflows</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/DonvanGrobler">GitHub profile</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
